  "ingredients": [
    "6 egg whites",
    "0.5 teaspoon cream of tartar",
    "1 pinch salt",
    "1.3333333730698 cups white sugar",
    "2 teaspoons vanilla extract"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients. Preheat oven to 225 degrees F (110 degrees C). Line 2 baking sheets with aluminum foil and grease the foil.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Oo08h7H4l1bYeg7iCLNdHwiWZPA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-228248-meringue-bones-VAT-step-01-c1830f9313644840b4830731e72c33cb.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/228248/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Beat egg whites with cream of tartar and salt in a bowl with an electric mixer until egg whites are foamy.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/KkgGLNIW5olsJKXLKYQpmgvyod4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-228248-meringue-bones-VAT-step-02-45cba47a36674b938e1e2375a8c6f2cd.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/228248/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Gradually beat in sugar, a few tablespoons at a time, beating until the sugar dissolves in the meringue before adding more. Continue beating until the meringue is glossy and forms a sharp peak when beaters are lifted straight up out of the bowl; beat in vanilla extract.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Coxywpv55zFWkpg64lZAx-7EMo4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-228248-meringue-bones-VAT-step-03-f575883ec6494b08b53e93af8dfa51eb.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/228248/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Spoon the meringue into a pastry bag fitted with a small tip.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/EF9MtKhD0nCQc2t8KypYHyL3rRQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-228248-meringue-bones-VAT-step-04-1-ff82cb2e6d7c4f15946f60e06b31fab4.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/228248/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pipe meringue into small bone shapes on the prepared aluminum foil. You must pipe all the shapes at once or the meringue will deflate.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/hMp7MyVVU4ibjdthSTUlvQ8yY6E=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-228248-meringue-bones-VAT-step-05-52856caa7fe540359499e6b21e7df0fb.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/228248/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place cookie sheets into the preheated oven and bake for 1 hour. No not open oven door or peek during baking. Turn the oven off and let the meringue bones cool in the oven without opening door for 1 hour.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/UUns_7nOuSsvjYhRimzpPO8XrtQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-228248-meringue-bones-VAT-step-06-05a95e63484f464ba37b159c2ff6f719.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/228248/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Gently and carefully remove cookies from aluminum to prevent broken bones.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/zZl4n2WBIHBhtiDgYw2l1ccisU0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-228248-meringue-bones-VAT-step-07-1-bd9605b1fc224e61a0af77d2b81e887d.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/228248/step_07.webp"
    }
  ],
